# Defect 016's array shape (panel 230's R2, M-panic-location step 10): an `assert`
# on two arrays of arrays wrote its expression and no side, until the sides were written as
# the specification writes the values, in the lldb formatter's notation and
# within its bounds. The line checked is the one that shows the shape.

function main()
    grid = [[1, 2], [3]]
    other = [[1, 2], [3], []]
    assert grid == other
